sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application Code
    participant Wrapper as glibc Wrapper
    participant Syscall as System Call
    participant Kernel as Linux Kernel
    
    Note over App: High-level API
    App->>Wrapper: fopen("file.txt", "r")
    Note over Wrapper: Buffer management, Error handling, Format conversion
    Wrapper->>Syscall: open("file.txt", O_RDONLY)
    Note over Syscall: Set syscall number, Invoke via syscall instruction
    Syscall->>Kernel: sys_open()
    Kernel-->>Syscall: fd = 3
    Syscall-->>Wrapper: 3
    Note over Wrapper: Allocate FILE struct, Initialize buffer
    Wrapper-->>App: FILE *stream
    
    App->>Wrapper: fprintf(stream, "data")
    Wrapper->>Wrapper: Fill user buffer
    Note over Wrapper: Only write to kernel, when buffer full
    Wrapper->>Syscall: write(3, buf, 4096)
    Syscall->>Kernel: sys_write()
    Kernel-->>Syscall: bytes written
    Syscall-->>Wrapper: 4096
    Wrapper-->>App: success
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over App,Wrapper: User Space
    end
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Kernel: Kernel Space
    end
